    {
      "example": "38:c8:**:**:f5:22",
      "help_en": "Device MAC address  \nNote: If MAC, UUID, and SN are all provided, the system queries based on the correctly entered values. If all provided values are valid, the query Priority follows the order: UUID > MAC > SN.  \nIf any one of MAC, UUID, or SN is provided, the hotel ID and channel number do not need to be provided.  ",
